@host = http://localhost:5219

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Login com o usuário de demonstração
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@financas.app",
  "password": "Demo@12345"
}

### Guarda o token retornado pelo login
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Dashboard (mês atual)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lançamentos do mês
GET {{host}}/api/transactions?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar uma despesa
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Padaria",
  "amount": 23.50,
  "type": "Expense",
  "status": "Confirmed",
  "transactionDate": "2026-10-12"
}

### Contas
GET {{host}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Categorias
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Provedor de integração bancária (modo demo)
GET {{host}}/api/banking/provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
